{"target": "html", "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Nimbus</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background-color: #f8fafc;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n    [data-screen] {\n      \n      width: 100vw;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n    }\n    [data-screen].active {\n      \n    }\n    .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 6px;\n    }\n    .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: #cbd5e1;\n      border-radius: 3px;\n    }\n  </style>\n<style>[data-screen]:not(.active){display:none!important}</style></head>\n<body class=\"overflow-x-hidden text-slate-900\">\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       SCREEN 1: NIMBUS DASHBOARD\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section data-screen=\"dashboard\" class=\"active flex w-full min-h-screen bg-[#f8fafc]\">\n    <!-- Sidebar -->\n    <aside class=\"w-[232px] bg-[#0d1527] text-slate-300 flex flex-col justify-between shrink-0 select-none py-5 px-3 min-h-screen\">\n      <div>\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 mb-6 cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"navigateTo('landing')\">\n          <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-400 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\"></div>\n          <span class=\"text-white text-xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Nimbus</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Nav -->\n        <nav class=\"space-y-1\">\n          <button onclick=\"navigateTo('dashboard')\" class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#1a233a] text-white font-medium text-sm transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-400\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"12\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"16\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>\n            <span>Dashboard</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/></svg>\n            <span>Projects</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"/><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\"/></svg>\n            <span>My tasks</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"4\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"14\"/></svg>\n            <span>Reports</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg>\n            <span>Team</span>\n          </button>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Footer Nav -->\n      <div class=\"space-y-1 pb-2\">\n        <button onclick=\"navigateTo('settings')\" class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-sm font-medium transition\">\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Settings</span>\n        </button>\n        <button onclick=\"navigateTo('login')\" class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4\"/><polyline points=\"16 17 21 12 16 7\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>\n          <span>Log out</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <!-- Content Area -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-screen overflow-y-auto\">\n      <!-- Top header bar -->\n      <header class=\"h-[64px] px-8 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between bg-white shrink-0\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-[360px]\">\n          <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search projects and tasks...\" class=\"w-full h-[38px] bg-[#f1f5f9] rounded-lg px-4 text-xs placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500 text-slate-700\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <button class=\"w-[38px] h-[36px] rounded-lg border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"/><path d=\"M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0\"/></svg>\n          </button>\n          <div onclick=\"navigateTo('settings')\" class=\"w-[37px] h-[36px] rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-semibold text-xs cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition\">\n            AK\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Main Body -->\n      <div class=\"p-8 max-w-[1040px] w-full\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n          <div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">Dashboard</h1>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1\">Good morning, Asha. Here is your team this week.</p>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"h-[38px] px-4 bg-[#4f46e5] hover:bg-[#4338ca] text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n            + New project\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 4 Metric Cards -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm\">\n            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-slate-500 font-medium\">Active projects</div>\n            <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2\">12</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 mt-2\">+2 this month</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm\">\n            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-slate-500 font-medium\">Tasks due this week</div>\n            <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2\">38</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 mt-2\">9 due today</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm\">\n            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-slate-500 font-medium\">Completed</div>\n            <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2\">214</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 mt-2\">+18% vs last week</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm\">\n            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-slate-500 font-medium\">Team members</div>\n            <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-2\">9</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 mt-2\">2 invited</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Recent Projects Table -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden\">\n          <div class=\"px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\">Recent projects</h2>\n            <button class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700\">View all</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n            <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400 tracking-wider uppercase border-b border-slate-100 bg-[#fafafa]/50\">\n                  <th class=\"py-3 px-6\">PROJECT</th>\n                  <th class=\"py-3 px-6\">OWNER</th>\n                  <th class=\"py-3 px-6\">PROGRESS</th>\n                  <th class=\"py-3 px-6\">STATUS</th>\n                  <th class=\"py-3 px-6 text-right\">DUE</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-medium\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Website relaunch</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-slate-600\">Asha K.</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-32 bg-slate-100 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                      <div class=\"bg-[#4f46e5] h-full rounded-full\" style=\"width: 65%;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-100\">On track</span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-right text-slate-600\">18 Oct</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Mobile app v2</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-slate-600\">Rohan M.</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-32 bg-slate-100 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                      <div class=\"bg-[#4f46e5] h-full rounded-full\" style=\"width: 45%;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-100\">At risk</span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-right text-slate-600\">2 Nov</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Billing migration</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-slate-600\">Leah T.</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-32 bg-slate-100 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                      <div class=\"bg-[#4f46e5] h-full rounded-full\" style=\"width: 15%;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-100\">Blocked</span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-right text-slate-600\">25 Oct</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50\">\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-slate-900 font-semibold\">Onboarding emails</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-slate-600\">Asha K.</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-32 bg-slate-100 h-1.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                      <div class=\"bg-[#4f46e5] h-full rounded-full\" style=\"width: 85%;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-medium bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-100\">On track</span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td class=\"py-4 px-6 text-right text-slate-600\">14 Oct</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       SCREEN 2: NIMBUS LANDING PAGE\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section data-screen=\"landing\" class=\"flex flex-col w-full min-h-screen bg-[#f8fafc]\">\n    <!-- Navbar -->\n    <header class=\"h-[68px] border-b border-slate-100 px-14 flex items-center justify-between bg-white sticky top-0 z-20\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-10\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"navigateTo('landing')\">\n          <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-400 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\"></div>\n          <span class=\"text-slate-900 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Nimbus</span>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-7 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition\">Features</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition\">Pricing</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition\">Customers</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition\">Docs</a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <button onclick=\"navigateTo('login')\" class=\"h-10 px-5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">Log in</button>\n        <button onclick=\"navigateTo('dashboard')\" class=\"h-10 px-5 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-[#4f46e5] hover:bg-[#4338ca] rounded-lg shadow-sm transition\">Start free trial</button>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Hero Area -->\n    <div class=\"px-14 pt-12 pb-14 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto w-full\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12\">\n        <!-- Left copy -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 max-w-[530px]\">\n          <div class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 mb-6\">\n            New \u00b7 Sprint reports\n          </div>\n          <h1 class=\"text-[44px] leading-[1.1] font-extrabold text-slate-950 tracking-tight mb-4\">\n            Plan projects your team actually finishes.\n          </h1>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[460px]\">\n            Nimbus keeps tasks, deadlines and progress in one shared board, so nothing slips between meetings.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <button onclick=\"navigateTo('dashboard')\" class=\"h-[48px] px-6 text-xs font-bold text-white bg-[#4f46e5] hover:bg-[#4338ca] rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-indigo-100 transition\">\n              Start free trial\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"h-[48px] px-6 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl hover:bg-white bg-slate-50 transition\">\n              Book a demo\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right: Kanban mockup graphic -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 w-full flex justify-end\">\n          <div class=\"w-full max-w-[540px] bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-5 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-200/50\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3\">\n              <!-- Col 1 -->\n              <div class=\"bg-slate-50/70 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-2.5\">\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">TO DO</div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-indigo-600 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-indigo-600 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-indigo-600 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <!-- Col 2 -->\n              <div class=\"bg-slate-50/70 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-2.5\">\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">IN PROGRESS</div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-amber-500 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-amber-500 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <!-- Col 3 -->\n              <div class=\"bg-slate-50/70 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-2.5\">\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">DONE</div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-emerald-500 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-emerald-500 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-emerald-500 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 border-l-4 border-l-emerald-500 h-10 shadow-sm\"></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Feature cards -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-16\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\">\n          <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 mb-4\"></div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1\">Shared boards</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">Drag tasks across stages and see who owns what.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\">\n          <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 mb-4\"></div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1\">Deadline alerts</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">Get nudged before a due date, not after it.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm\">\n          <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 mb-4\"></div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1\">Sprint reports</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">Weekly progress charts your manager can read.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-slate-100 py-6 px-14 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 bg-white\">\n      <div>\u00a9 2026 Nimbus Labs</div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-800 transition\">Privacy</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-800 transition\">Terms</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-800 transition\">Contact</a>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       SCREEN 3: NIMBUS LOGIN PAGE\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section data-screen=\"login\" class=\"flex w-full min-h-screen\">\n    <!-- Left Hero Testimonial Panel -->\n    <div class=\"hidden lg:flex w-[520px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#3b5bfd] via-[#3252f0] to-[#0d7490] p-12 text-white flex-col justify-between shrink-0\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"navigateTo('landing')\">\n        <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-white/20 backdrop-blur flex items-center justify-center\"></div>\n        <span class=\"text-white text-xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Nimbus</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mb-8\">\n        <blockquote class=\"text-[26px] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight mb-4\">\n          \u201cWe stopped losing tasks in Slack threads the week we moved to Nimbus.\u201d\n        </blockquote>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white/80\">\n          Priya Raman, Engineering Lead at Fernway\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right Login Form Panel -->\n    <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#f8fafc] flex items-center justify-center p-6\">\n      <div class=\"w-full max-w-[400px]\">\n        <div class=\"mb-7\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">Log in to Nimbus</h2>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1.5\">Welcome back. Pick up where your team left off.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <form onsubmit=\"handleLogin(event)\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div>\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1.5\">Work email</label>\n            <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@company.com\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-800 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 shadow-sm transition\">\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1.5\">Password</label>\n            <input type=\"password\" required value=\"secretpass\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-800 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 shadow-sm transition\">\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs pt-1\">\n            <label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer text-slate-600\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" checked class=\"rounded border-slate-300 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-0\">\n              <span>Remember me</span>\n            </label>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700 font-medium\">Forgot password?</a>\n          </div>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full h-11 bg-[#4f46e5] hover:bg-[#4338ca] text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-lg shadow-sm transition mt-2\">\n            Log in\n          </button>\n        </form>\n\n        <div class=\"relative my-6 text-center\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center\"><div class=\"w-full border-t border-slate-200\"></div></div>\n          <span class=\"relative bg-[#f8fafc] px-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider\">or</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <button onclick=\"navigateTo('dashboard')\" class=\"w-full h-11 bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition\">\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n            <path fill=\"#4285F4\" d=\"M23.745 12.27c0-.7-.06-1.4-.19-2.07H12v4.51h6.6c-.29 1.52-1.14 2.8-2.4 3.65v3.03h3.88c2.28-2.1 3.66-5.2 3.66-9.12z\"/>\n            <path fill=\"#34A853\" d=\"M12 24c3.24 0 5.95-1.08 7.93-2.91l-3.88-3.03c-1.08.72-2.45 1.16-4.05 1.16-3.12 0-5.77-2.1-6.72-4.93H1.25v3.13C3.26 21.36 7.34 24 12 24z\"/>\n            <path fill=\"#FBBC05\" d=\"M5.28 14.29c-.25-.72-.38-1.49-.38-2.29s.13-1.57.38-2.29V6.58H1.25C.45 8.18 0 9.98 0 12s.45 3.82 1.25 5.42l4.03-3.13z\"/>\n            <path fill=\"#EA4335\" d=\"M12 4.75c1.77 0 3.35.61 4.6 1.8l3.42-3.42C17.95 1.19 15.24 0 12 0 7.34 0 3.26 2.64 1.25 6.58l4.03 3.13c.95-2.83 3.6-4.96 6.72-4.96z\"/>\n          </svg>\n          Continue with Google\n        </button>\n\n        <p class=\"text-center text-xs text-slate-500 mt-6\">\n          New to Nimbus? <a href=\"#\" onclick=\"navigateTo('landing')\" class=\"text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700 font-semibold\">Create an account</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       SCREEN 4: SETTINGS PAGE\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section data-screen=\"settings\" class=\"flex w-full min-h-screen bg-[#f8fafc]\">\n    <!-- Sidebar -->\n    <aside class=\"w-[232px] bg-[#0d1527] text-slate-300 flex flex-col justify-between shrink-0 select-none py-5 px-3 min-h-screen\">\n      <div>\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 mb-6 cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"navigateTo('landing')\">\n          <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-400 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\"></div>\n          <span class=\"text-white text-xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Nimbus</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Nav -->\n        <nav class=\"space-y-1\">\n          <button onclick=\"navigateTo('dashboard')\" class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"12\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"16\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>\n            <span>Dashboard</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/></svg>\n            <span>Projects</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"/><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\"/></svg>\n            <span>My tasks</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"4\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"14\"/></svg>\n            <span>Reports</span>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg>\n            <span>Team</span>\n          </button>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Footer Nav -->\n      <div class=\"space-y-1 pb-2\">\n        <button onclick=\"navigateTo('settings')\" class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#1a233a] text-white font-medium text-sm transition\">\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-400\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Settings</span>\n        </button>\n        <button onclick=\"navigateTo('login')\" class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-red-400 text-sm font-medium transition\">\n          <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4\"/><polyline points=\"16 17 21 12 16 7\"/><line x1=\"21\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>\n          <span>Log out</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <!-- Content Area -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-screen overflow-y-auto\">\n      <!-- Top header bar -->\n      <header class=\"h-[64px] px-8 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between bg-white shrink-0\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-[360px]\">\n          <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search projects and tasks...\" class=\"w-full h-[38px] bg-[#f1f5f9] rounded-lg px-4 text-xs placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500 text-slate-700\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <button class=\"w-[38px] h-[36px] rounded-lg border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-50\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9\"/><path d=\"M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0\"/></svg>\n          </button>\n          <div onclick=\"navigateTo('dashboard')\" class=\"w-[37px] h-[36px] rounded-full bg-[#f59e0b] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-semibold text-xs cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition\">\n            AK\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Main Body -->\n      <div class=\"p-8 max-w-[800px] w-full\">\n        <div>\n          <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">Settings</h1>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1\">Manage your profile and how Nimbus notifies you.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation Tabs -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 mt-6 border-b border-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold\">\n          <button class=\"text-indigo-600 pb-3 border-b-2 border-indigo-600\">Profile</button>\n          <button class=\"text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 pb-3 transition\">Notifications</button>\n          <button class=\"text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 pb-3 transition\">Billing</button>\n          <button class=\"text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 pb-3 transition\">Integrations</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Settings Card Container -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm mt-6\">\n          <div class=\"mb-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\">Profile</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">This is how teammates see you on boards and comments.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1.5\">Full name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"setting-name\" value=\"Asha Kapoor\" class=\"w-full h-10 px-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500\">\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1.5\">Work email</label>\n              <input type=\"email\" id=\"setting-email\" value=\"asha@fernway.io\" class=\"w-full h-10 px-3.5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-xs text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-indigo-500\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"border-t border-slate-100 pt-5 space-y-4 mb-8\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800\">Email me about due dates</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">A daily digest of tasks due in the next 48 hours</div>\n              </div>\n              <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"toggleSwitch(this)\" class=\"w-10 h-6 bg-[#4f46e5] rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors relative flex items-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-white rounded-full shadow transform translate-x-4 transition-transform\"></div>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800\">Weekly sprint report</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">Sent every Monday at 9:00</div>\n              </div>\n              <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"toggleSwitch(this)\" class=\"w-10 h-6 bg-slate-300 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors relative flex items-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-white rounded-full shadow transform translate-x-0 transition-transform\"></div>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\">\n            <button onclick=\"navigateTo('dashboard')\" class=\"h-9 px-4 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 rounded-lg transition\">\n              Cancel\n            </button>\n            <button onclick=\"navigateTo('dashboard')\" class=\"h-9 px-4 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-[#4f46e5] hover:bg-[#4338ca] rounded-lg transition shadow-sm\">\n              Save changes\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Navigation script -->\n  <script>\n    function navigateTo(screenName) {\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-screen]').forEach(el => {\n        el.classList.remove('active');\n      });\n      const target = document.querySelector(`[data-screen=\"${screenName}\"]`);\n      if (target) {\n        target.classList.add('active');\n        window.scrollTo(0, 0);\n      }\n    }\n\n    function handleLogin(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      navigateTo('dashboard');\n    }\n\n    function toggleSwitch(btn) {\n      const circle = btn.querySelector('div');\n      const isOn = btn.classList.contains('bg-[#4f46e5]');\n      if (isOn) {\n        btn.classList.remove('bg-[#4f46e5]');\n        btn.classList.add('bg-slate-300');\n        circle.classList.remove('translate-x-4');\n        circle.classList.add('translate-x-0');\n      } else {\n        btn.classList.remove('bg-slate-300');\n        btn.classList.add('bg-[#4f46e5]');\n        circle.classList.remove('translate-x-0');\n        circle.classList.add('translate-x-4');\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "notes": ["Built all 4 screens directly in one single-file HTML layout with active view toggles.", "Wired sidebar links, Settings button, profile avatar AK, Log in/out buttons, and Start free trial CTAs to switch between Dashboard, Settings, Login, and Landing page.", "Added toggle switch state toggles and demo form submit handler on Login page.", "Recreated custom layouts, colors (#0d1527 sidebar, #4f46e5 brand purple, etc.), and typography using Plus Jakarta Sans."], "source": "ai", "screens": ["digital-981de6d519284b13", "digital-787a03e1dff055c8", "digital-95ba79724c537b6f", "digital-cb6d1d6fa0620d4f"], "provider": {"name": "google-gemini", "model": "gemini-3.8-flash"}, "change": "Whole site from 4 screens", "size": {"width": 1280, "height": 800}}